{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1230759-essence-bleed","id":1230759,"title":"Essence bleed","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-06-28T01:38:11-07:00","id":1230759,"title":"Essence bleed","content":"Hello to everyone, <br /> i don t know if i m understanding it rightly but by the rules in the core rulebooks the resonant and infrastructure condition doesn t seem to grant protection from essence bleed to the corresponding entity, am i right? <br /> <br /> Werewolf core says that a spirit in the shadow is safe from essence bleed but what about other entities (for example a ghost who entered through a verge)?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24346-neos01","name":"Neos01","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24346_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1021"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-28T05:45:52-07:00","id":1230774,"title":"","content":"You know, I had always implicitly assumed that spirits didn't bleed around Resonance, or angels in Infrastructure, but all the rulebooks I've checked square with your reading. So while I have no answer for you, I will be watching this thread.<br /> <br /> My assumption was that a ghost stranded in the Shadow would bleed Essence unless it was somehow able to hang around an Anchor there. There's room for strange edge cases, though, like a ghost who managed to survive cannibalizing spirits for Essence and becoming more like a spirit itself. There's always room for strange edge cases.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-28T05:56:59-07:00","id":1230778,"title":"","content":"Spirits need to use the Resonant Condition as a base from which they can establish a Manifestation, many of which prevent Essence Bleed. Once a Manifestation is secured (usually Fetter), they are safe from Essence Bleed for however long the Manifestation lasts.<br /> <br /> Like Stupid Loserman said, a ghost in the Shadow will Bleed Essence unless it\u2019s still in range of an anchor. Although if the ghost is a Familiar that would also prevent Essence Bleed since a Familiar\u2019s Range is unlimited.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2632,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","user":"Mrmdubois","date":". 06-28-2018, 09:00 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-28T06:42:57-07:00","id":1230794,"title":"","content":"The Familiar bond is indeed a powerful incentive, at least for those applicable. <br /> <br /> Tangentially related; Geist 2E previews tell us that ghosts who get drained of all Essence while in the Underworld are essentially eaten by the Underworld, becoming part of it. I wonder if anything interesting happens to other ephemerals in the Underworld...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-29T10:05:13-07:00","id":1231139,"title":"","content":"I'll be watching this thread as well as these are some interesting questions I hadn't considered.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23958-tengugrib","name":"TenguGrib","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23958_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"70"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-30T04:11:50-07:00","id":1231333,"title":"","content":"Werewolf core book says: &quot;Spirits in the material world but outside of a suitable Condition bleed one point of Essence per hour.&quot;<br /> So spirits in the Shadow do not Bleed essence but what about other planes? <br /> I think that essence bleed maybe is a byproduct of the Twilight phase and only the material plane has a &quot;natural&quot; twilight (maybe the Death realm in the temenos has another one). <br /> Probably geist 2 ed will clarify the subject, the Underworld &quot;eats&quot; zero essence ghost but does it still impose essence bleed?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24346-neos01","name":"Neos01","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24346_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1021"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-30T07:43:52-07:00","id":1231354,"title":"","content":"Considering the nature of the Underworld, and the preview descriptions, my guess is that ghosts are protected from the more severe version of it, but that they probably still lose Essence at probably a point a day while there. I\u2019m sure there are opportunities to get more than that from their environment, but when a ghost is in a poor way for story purposes the ST could use that as a pressure point on the players. That would help drive the desperation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-17T02:40:27-07:00","id":1235848,"title":"","content":"The manuscript of Geist 2e confirm that there is no essence bleed in the underworld (but something really worse happens instead)<br /> So it seems to me that essence bleed is a direct consecuence of the Twilight state. <br /> Do you think it's correct?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24346-neos01","name":"Neos01","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24346_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1021"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-17T05:49:51-07:00","id":1235877,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Neos01</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1230759-essence-bleed?p=1235848#post1235848\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The manuscript of Geist 2e confirm that there is no essence bleed in the underworld (but something really worse happens instead)<br /> So it seems to me that essence bleed is a direct consecuence of the Twilight state. <br /> Do you think it's correct?</div> </div> </div> </div>Pretty sure you\u2019re only protected from Essence Bleed in Dominions and other special locations, otherwise you do lose Essence. I\u2019ll have to double check though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-17T06:34:06-07:00","id":1235888,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1230759-essence-bleed?p=1235877#post1235877\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Pretty sure you\u2019re only protected from Essence Bleed in Dominions and other special locations, otherwise you do lose Essence. I\u2019ll have to double check though.</div> </div> </div> </div>Essence Bleed doesn't happen unless you're a Kerberos outside your Dominion but the daily point loss is more dangerous; considering geister are protected from Essence bleed and ghosts who've resolved all of their Anchors have as well, I think it's more a consequence of having Anchors.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-17T10:02:35-07:00","id":1235979,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1230759-essence-bleed?p=1235888#post1235888\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Essence Bleed doesn't happen unless you're a Kerberos outside your Dominion but the daily point loss is more dangerous; considering geister are protected from Essence bleed and ghosts who've resolved all of their Anchors have as well, I think it's more a consequence of having Anchors.</div> </div> </div> </div>Do you think you can expand on the latter part of your post, particularly what you think the consequence of having Anchors is in terms of Essence bleed?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-17T18:05:30-07:00","id":1236227,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1230759-essence-bleed?p=1235979#post1235979\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do you think you can expand on the latter part of your post, particularly what you think the consequence of having Anchors is in terms of Essence bleed?</div> </div> </div> </div>The short version is &quot;having Anchors means the Underworld gets to grab you when you lose them, and that sort of fits its entire M.O.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"us